abstract: >-
  A synthetic prober and Prometheus exporter with prebuilt Grafana dashboards
  that measures per-model LLM latency (time-to-first-token, total latency,
  streaming throughput, rate-limit pressure) across Claude, OpenAI, and Gemini
  models, at model-ID granularity rather than lab-level rollups.
